sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Tracker
    participant p1 as Secure Ingest
    participant p2 as Event Broker
    participant p3 as Geo Processor
    participant p4 as Time Series DB
    participant p5 as Alert Worker
    p0->>p1: Signed coordinates and timestamp
    p1->>p2: Append telemetry
    p2->>p3: Process keyed stream
    p3->>p4: Write historic points
    p3->>p5: Emit credible boundary crossing
    p5->>p0: Optional device notification
